      "context": "system — right-click / ⇧F10 / ⋯ on tracks, playlists, artists; long-press or ⋯ on mobile — Desktop uses the Context Menu (shadcn): icons, shortcuts, group labels, separators, checkbox items, side submenus, disabled and destructive items. Mobile uses the Drawer (shadcn/vaul): media header, 52px rows, submenus open as the next drawer step, Cancel at the bottom."
